{"seq":4,"slug":"optimization","title":"第 4 章：发布效能优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-frequency-cadence","title":"发布频率与节奏设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/optimization/release-frequency-cadence","wordCount":2079,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"release-observability","title":"发布可观测性体系建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/optimization/release-observability","wordCount":1857,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"release-culture-organization","title":"发布文化与组织能力建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/optimization/release-culture-organization","wordCount":2156,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第-4-章-发布效能优化\">第 4 章：发布效能优化</h1><p>前三章解决了&quot;如何安全地发布&quot;的问题，本章转向&quot;如何更高效地发布&quot;——不是追求更快的频率本身，而是找到团队、系统和业务三方平衡的节奏，并通过可观测性和文化建设持续放大发布能力。</p>\n<p>第一篇分析发布频率与节奏的设计原则，帮助团队找到最适合自身的发布韵律。第二篇构建发布可观测性体系——用数据驱动发布决策而非依赖直觉。第三篇讨论组织层面的发布文化建设——工具再好，如果团队不信任发布流程，速度也上不去。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"release-frequency-cadence\">发布频率与节奏设计</a></td>\n<td>频率选择因素、节奏模式、批次大小理论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"release-observability\">发布可观测性</a></td>\n<td>DORA 指标、发布追踪、异常检测、仪表盘设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"release-culture-organization\">发布文化与组织</a></td>\n<td>信任建设、职责模型、跨团队协同、持续改进</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}